# Give plain spoken status updates

Josh listens to progress updates. Use plain spoken paragraphs: what changed,
what it means for him and what is happening now. Avoid tables, code names,
hashes and path lists in routine status. Verify current work before reporting
it, and disclose recorded gaps. See [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md).
